                        "source_entry_id": "b6553c5a-bf24-375d-8b64-14040ee88d08",
                        "source_sense_id": "1bd8ba64-cca5-37ed-b04a-04e8b1158d39",
                        "source_sense_description": "Lutschpastille gegen Begleiterscheinungen einer Erkältung, wie rauhen Hals und Hustenreiz",
                        "target_lang_word": "lozenge",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "lozenge",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b69cb300-3379-30e4-8313-baacb1506db5",
                                        "entry_id": "abf0ab82-cbb4-334d-a210-74e09df3e67a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A thin rhombus, having two acute and two obtuse angles."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a20565e2-d8fd-45a0-bcd1-6b8b8dbf5bdc",
                                                "sense_id": "b69cb300-3379-30e4-8313-baacb1506db5",
                                                "text": "Wherein the decussis is made within a longilaterall square, with opposite angles, acute and obtuse at the intersection; and so upon progression making a Rhombus or Lozenge figuration [...]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d610bc30-c2d8-4a5d-93f9-b07d79cc8a67",
                                                "sense_id": "b69cb300-3379-30e4-8313-baacb1506db5",
                                                "text": "How the junior partner of Hobbs and Dobbs leads her smiling to the carriage with the lozenge upon it, and the fat wheezy coachman!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2b6254f4-2864-49eb-bdac-e6024e7c7e27",
                                                "sense_id": "b69cb300-3379-30e4-8313-baacb1506db5",
                                                "text": "The floor is constructed from marble lozenges and triangles of every imaginable hue: yellow and pink and all manner of mottled and blotched shades, framed in white."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "851d77df-6ece-38a0-8ae5-3acb79369ade",
                                        "entry_id": "abf0ab82-cbb4-334d-a210-74e09df3e67a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A small tablet (originally diamond-shaped) or medicated sweet used to ease a sore throat."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "925ac663-8ae8-49c6-bc2e-db4c52afacbf",
                                                "sense_id": "851d77df-6ece-38a0-8ae5-3acb79369ade",
                                                "text": "One saint's day in mid-term a certain newly appointed suffragan-bishop came to the school chapel, and there preached on “The Inner Life.” He at once secured attention by his informal method, and when presently the coughing of Jarvis […] interrupted the sermon, he altogether captivated his audience with a remark about cough lozenges being cheap and easily procurable."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8ef47fda-7286-4348-8ec9-599f8af0883b",
                                                "sense_id": "851d77df-6ece-38a0-8ae5-3acb79369ade",
                                                "text": "In the same way that Old Europe’s coffeehouses begat insurance companies, he says, today’s political careers beget an unhealthy relationship with throat lozenges."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
